          "description": "Vogel Veterinary Emergency and Specialty is a trusted 24/7 animal hospital in Stratham, NH providing advanced emergency and specialty veterinary care to pets throughout the Seacoast region. Our experienced team delivers around-the-clock emergency vet services, urgent care for pets, and lifesaving treatment when it matters most. We also offer board-certified veterinary dermatology for chronic skin conditions and allergies, comprehensive veterinary oncology for cancer diagnosis and treatment, and advanced soft tissue and orthopedic surgery. Serving Stratham, Exeter, Portsmouth, Greenland, Newmarket, and surrounding New Hampshire communities, Vogel Veterinary Emergency and Specialty is committed to compassionate, expert care for dogs and cats—day or night.",
